        },
        {
          "text": "Uyakuphenduka nokuphenduka ngobudlova, akuphonse njengebhola ezweni elibanzi, ufele khona, izinqola zenkazimulo yakho zibe yihlazo lendlu yenkosi yakho.",
          "type": "text",
