              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyomembathisa ingubo yakho, ngimqinise ngebhande lakho, nginikele umbuso wakho esandleni sakhe, abe nguyise kwabakhileyo eJerusalema nakuyo indlu yakwaJuda.",
