              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakusibeka isihluthulelo sendlu kaDavide ehlombe lakhe; kanjalo uyakuvula, kungavali muntu; futhi uyovala, futhi akekho oyovula.",
          "type": "text",
